{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113398","id":3059391226,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc62Wpr6","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113398","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113398.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113398.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113398","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113398/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113398/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113398/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b1ef01dceeb75693c49ec570d03d7c72f6629709","number":113398,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix MovieWriter checking wrong directory for disk space","user":{"login":"Eshaan-byte","id":146680427,"node_id":"U_kgDOCL4qaw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146680427?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eshaan-byte","html_url":"https://github.com/Eshaan-byte","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eshaan-byte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eshaan-byte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eshaan-byte/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eshaan-byte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eshaan-byte/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eshaan-byte/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eshaan-byte/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eshaan-byte/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eshaan-byte/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #113391\r\n\r\nMovieWriter was incorrectly checking disk space on the current working directory instead of the target output directory specified in `--write-movie`.\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\nChanged `get_basename()` to `get_base_dir()` in `movie_writer.cpp:117` to properly extract the directory path where the movie file will be written.\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n- `get_basename()` on `/path/to/output.avi` → `/path/to/output` (not a valid directory)\r\n- `dir->open()` would open the current working directory\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n- `get_base_dir()` on `/path/to/output.avi` → `/path/to` (correct directory)\r\n- `dir->open()` opens the actual target directory\r\n\r\n## Impact\r\n- Users will now get accurate disk space warnings for the target directory\r\n- Prevents false positives when CWD has low space but target has plenty\r\n- Prevents missing warnings when target has low space but CWD has plenty\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://ap